  <diagram name="Idea for Solution" id="69iW75QBVthA2ZMNfBCq">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1717" dy="1047" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="900" backgroundImage="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;data:page/id,QbE8TqDRo5yMwSRJmee9&quot;}" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="RDitD0eHoifv9DF8FGZm-0" />
        <mxCell id="RDitD0eHoifv9DF8FGZm-1" parent="RDitD0eHoifv9DF8FGZm-0" />
        <mxCell id="RDitD0eHoifv9DF8FGZm-2" parent="RDitD0eHoifv9DF8FGZm-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=1" value="A Searchable Time Capsule for Every Milestone" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="57" width="541" x="530" y="71" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RDitD0eHoifv9DF8FGZm-3" parent="RDitD0eHoifv9DF8FGZm-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=22;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;div&gt;- The silos are there for a reason: each is a specialized tool doing an important job. They all stay.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- A release, an audit, a major decision: at moments like these, a scoped snapshot of each relevant silo is archived together — the project context, exactly as it was that day.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Every tool has a shelf life: today&#39;s indispensable app is tomorrow&#39;s discontinued product. The data&#39;s value outlives the tool&#39;s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- So the snapshots enter in open formats: plain text, JSON, SQL, PDF. Readable and searchable years from now, without any proprietary software.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="482" width="664" x="810" y="253" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fET7I8EhMS8-Oc4GkmIR-0" connectable="0" parent="RDitD0eHoifv9DF8FGZm-1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="46" width="128" x="331" y="297" as="geometry" />
