        <mxCell id="77JLTV78luElHyAv88K--57" parent="IpIWYKTjJhMpEOg0NUx2-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;div&gt;Imagine: a year after the release, a vulnerability shipped with that release&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;causes serious damage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The questions come:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &quot;Did you know about the CVE at the time of release?&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &quot;Did you consider it? Why did you accept the risk? How did you judge the situation?&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &quot;Can you prove you ran the tests? Was the problem visible in the logs?&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &quot;Were the unit tests executed at build time? What was the coverage? Did it cover the critical section?&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &quot;Who ran the tests, and when? Were they qualified to judge the results?&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &quot;And can you prove none of this was altered since?&quot;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="1090" x="242" y="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="77JLTV78luElHyAv88K--58" connectable="0" parent="IpIWYKTjJhMpEOg0NUx2-1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
